@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000
@playerId = 0192f28f-5dc0-7d58-bdb2-814ad6a0f4a1

### Liveness
GET {{baseUrl}}/health/live

### Readiness de PostgreSQL e SQS
GET {{baseUrl}}/health/ready

### Criar carteira
POST {{baseUrl}}/wallets
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "playerId": "{{playerId}}",
  "initialBalance": { "amount": "100.00", "currency": "BRL" }
}

### Substitua pelo id retornado acima
@walletId = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000

### Apostar
POST {{baseUrl}}/wagering/transactions
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: provider-a:bet-001

{
  "providerId": "provider-a",
  "externalTransactionId": "bet-001",
  "playerId": "{{playerId}}",
  "walletId": "{{walletId}}",
  "roundId": "round-001",
  "gameId": "fortune-chimp",
  "kind": "BET",
  "money": { "amount": "25.00", "currency": "BRL" }
}

### Refund idempotente da aposta
POST {{baseUrl}}/wagering/transactions
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: provider-a:refund-001

{
  "providerId": "provider-a",
  "externalTransactionId": "refund-001",
  "playerId": "{{playerId}}",
  "walletId": "{{walletId}}",
  "roundId": "round-001",
  "gameId": "fortune-chimp",
  "kind": "REFUND",
  "money": { "amount": "25.00", "currency": "BRL" },
  "referenceExternalTransactionId": "bet-001"
}

### Consultar carteira
GET {{baseUrl}}/wallets/{{walletId}}

### Ledger paginado
GET {{baseUrl}}/wallets/{{walletId}}/ledger?limit=50

### Reconciliação sem reparo automático
POST {{baseUrl}}/wallets/{{walletId}}/reconciliation

### Consulta por ID interno
@transactionId = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
GET {{baseUrl}}/wagering/transactions/{{transactionId}}

### Consulta pela identidade do provedor
GET {{baseUrl}}/providers/provider-a/wagering/transactions/bet-001
